.TH RETICULUM-GO-SNAPSHOT 1 "2026" "reticulum-go" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
reticulum-go snapshot, rgosnap \- path table, links, and health JSON over RPC
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B reticulum-go snapshot
[\fB\-config\fR \fIdir\fR]
[\fB\-max-hops\fR \fIn\fR]
[\fB\-timeout\fR \fIduration\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Query a running shared instance and print one JSON object with interface
stats, path table rows, active link count, and transport health drop counters.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR reticulum-go-status (1),
.BR reticulum-go-path (1)
